# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored -- HashiCorp recommends
# committing it for reproducible provider versions across the team/CI.
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Lambda build artifacts (archive_file output -- rebuilt on every apply)
**/build/*.zip

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
